---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const SITE = Astro.site?.toString() ?? 'https://incenseherbs.com';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wholesale Chinese Botanical Incense — LanDeng"
  description="Wholesale inquiries for Chinese botanical incense — sticks, cones, sachets, and materials. Contact LanDeng for product range, MOQ, and specifications."
>
  <article class="article">
    <h1>Wholesale</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      LanDeng supplies Chinese botanical incense for wholesale and bulk orders. We work with
      natural materials — woods, resins, herbs and flowers — across stick, cone, sachet and raw-material
      formats.
    </p>

    <h2>What we supply</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Incense sticks</strong> (线香) — the common modern format</li>
      <li><strong>Incense cones</strong> (塔香) and <strong>coils</strong> (盘香)</li>
      <li><strong>Sachets</strong> (香囊)</li>
      <li><strong>Raw materials</strong> (香材) — woods, resins, herbs</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      New to buying incense in bulk? Start with our
      <a href="/blog/incense-for-business/">business buying guide</a> — it maps the wholesale,
      OEM, and private-label paths before you inquire.
    </p>

    <h2>How to inquire</h2>
    <p>
      To prepare an accurate quote, please tell us:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Product format and any specific ingredient(s) or aroma profile</li>
      <li>Target quantity</li>
      <li>Destination country/port</li>
      <li>Any packaging or specification requirements</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Confirmations we provide on inquiry</h2>
    <p>
      Because specifications vary by product and order, we confirm the following per inquiry rather
      than publishing fixed figures: <strong>MOQ, lead time, packaging options, certifications, and
      shipping terms.</strong>
    </p>

    <h2>What a bulk buyer should check</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Sample against the specification.</strong> Evaluate aroma, format, material and
        burn against the written spec before committing to volume — a sample verifies the product,
        not the supplier. See the <a href="/blog/samples-program/">samples program</a> and the
        <a href="/blog/wholesale-guide/">wholesale guide</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Documentation per order.</strong> For high-value botanicals (sandalwood, agarwood),
        request material test reports covering species, grade and adulteration — and verify them
        against the issuing body. See
        <a href="/blog/how-to-buy-agarwood-for-incense-manufacturing/">buying agarwood</a>, the
        <a href="/blog/incense-spec-sheet-coa/">spec sheet &amp; COA guide</a>, and the
        <a href="/blog/factory-vetting-guide/">vetting guide</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Storage and moisture handling.</strong> Botanical incense loses aroma when exposed
        to air and moisture; packaging must seal the product for transit and shelf life. Agree
        packaging before the run. See
        <a href="/blog/packaging-shipping-guide/">packaging &amp; shipping</a> and
        <a href="/blog/incense-storage-longevity/">storage &amp; longevity</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Destination requirements.</strong> Import rules for plant material, combustion
        products, and labeling vary by market — confirm what your destination requires before
        shipping. See <a href="/blog/incense-export-considerations/">export considerations</a>.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      What a supplier claim alone cannot establish — capacity, batch-to-batch consistency, and
      per-order compliance — is confirmed by documents, references, and the first order itself.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Request a quote</strong> — see our <a href="/request-a-quote/">quote request</a> page or
      <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> directly.
    </div>

    <p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-whatsapp"
        href="https://wa.me/8613323237275?text=Hello%20LanDeng%20%28wholesale%20inquiry%29"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Chat on WhatsApp
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
